## Origin and citation

This code is also archived on Zenodo as part of the dataset accompanying the
preprint below. If you use it, please cite both:

- Mohrlok, M. & Kaiser, C. (2026): An experimental model system to investigate
  microscale mechanisms behind the soil priming effect. bioRxiv.
  https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.07.14.738410
- Mohrlok, M. & Kaiser, C. (2026): Dataset for the article "An experimental
  model system to investigate microscale mechanisms behind the soil priming
